-- compare-at prices from products-10000.csv, and template descriptions in the
-- main store's own wording. Generated catalog data — NOT real supplier data.
-- Idempotent: deterministic uuid5 image ids + ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
-- compare UPDATEs keyed by SKU; description UPDATEs only fill NULLs.
